        {
            "id": "claim_4a6f0a2d49eb4b9693172d0b8f10a762",
            "statement": "Bank loading joins a bank's listed sound IDs to the sprite manifest to create buffer requests with manifest priority and estimated size; unknown manifest IDs are skipped, and a bank with no loadable entries immediately becomes `LOADED`. Unload stops the bank's sounds without tails, purges their pooled instances and cached URLs, then records `UNLOADED`.",
            "evidence": [
                {
                    "resource": "repo://packages/engine/src/Infrastructure/loader/BankManagerAdapter.ts#L53-L137",
                    "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:8a130bc26ce2ad17929c21e7310a769cdebaab8bafde04a6030d954bb333e566:"
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "id": "claim_5fd440ea83a748deab6430e125c9f66f",
            "statement": "`BankManagerAdapter` fetches and caches `IStreamManifest` JSON payloads from sprite-manifest URLs when loading banks containing stream sounds, while `unloadBank()` evicts cached stream manifests. `SoundController` uses the cached manifest from `BankManagerAdapter` in preference to a decoded buffer when playing that descriptor.",
